          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He has decreed punishment for the land of Hadrach and for the city of Damascus. Not only the tribes of Israel, but also the capital of Syria belong to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamath, which borders on Hadrach, also belongs to him, and so do the cities of Tyre and Sidon, with all their skill. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tyre has built fortifications for herself and has piled up so much silver and gold that it is as common as dirt! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the Lord will take away everything she has. He will throw her wealth into the sea, and the city will be burnt to the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
